\newlabel{fig:histo}{{2}{4}{Histogram of distances $d_j$ between dominant peaks of $|S(N)|$ for $N\le 10^4$. The distribution shows a pronounced cluster at short spacings (approximately $5$--$15$), a secondary cluster around $40$--$70$, and sparse larger gaps}{figure.2}{}}
